cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pain001-mockbank in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pain001-mockbank: a synthetic SFTP bank for pain001 integration tests"
abstract: >-
  An authenticated, bounded SFTP service that answers synthetic pain.001
  and pain.008 uploads with pain.002 acknowledgements, so a payment
  pipeline can be tested end to end without a real bank.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
version: "0.0.87"
date-released: "2026-11-12"
